        markdown
            p Widget Properties
            table
                thead
                    tr
                        th Property name
                        th Description
                tbody
                    tr
                        td `actions`
                        td Cover Click Action, `nothing`, `showCoverDetails` : the details appear as popup using dropblock functionality, `showLargeCover` : Displays a larger, high-res version of the cover image using figure viewr functionality, `linkToIssueOrBook` , `linkToSeriesHome` : Link to a user-specified location


            p Widget Properties
            table
                thead
                    tr
                        th Property name
                        th Description
                tbody
                    tr
                        td `coverImage.src`
                        td Cover image source path
                    tr
                        td `coverImage.alt`
                        td Cover image alt attribute value
                    tr
                        td `linkURL`
                        td Link to a user-specified location


    section.source_section

        h2 Examples

        h3 Single Cover image
        .source_example
            .container
                | !{pb.render('cover-image', 'single-cover-image.json', 'pericles')}

        h3 Single with Details - dropblock
        markdown
            p use `showCoverDetails` as action and enable `includeMetaData` checkbox in widget property to display the details in popup
            small note: click on the image to show details
        .source_example
            .container
                | !{pb.render('cover-image', 'dropblock.json', 'pericles', {"shared": {"model": {"config": {"wrapper": "true", "className": ["dropBlock"]}}}})}


        h3 Single with Details - Figure
        markdown
            p enabled `showLargeCover` checkbox in widget property to display a larger image
        .source_example
            .container
                | !{pb.render('cover-image', 'figure.json', 'pericles')}

        h3 Latest Issue
        markdown
            p use `linkToLatestIssue` as action to display the Latest Issue
        .source_example
            .container
                | !{pb.render('cover-image', 'latest-issue.json', 'pericles')}

        h3 Just Accepted and Ahead of Print
        markdown
            p contain `issueLabel` and `issueText` in json
            p these details have been added based on <a href='https://jira.atypon.com/browse/LIT-201786' target="_blank">`LIT-201786`</a>
        .source_example
            .container
                | !{pb.render('cover-image', 'ja.json', 'pericles')}


        .source_example
            .container
                | !{pb.render('cover-image' , 'aop.json', 'pericles')}


        h3 Virtual issue cover image
        markdown
            p use the alternative widget `alt-virtual-issue-cover-image` and add a wrapper class `cover-image__virtual-issue` for the following example
            p this option have been added based on <a href='https://jira.atypon.com/browse/LIT-184142' target="_blank">`LIT-184142`</a>
        .source_example
            .container
                | !{pb.render('cover-image', 'cover-image/alternative/alt-virtual-issue-cover-image', 'virtual-cover-image.json', 'pericles', {"shared": {"model": {"config": {"wrapper": "true", "className": ["cover-image__virtual-issue"]}}}})}

        h3 List of Covers given block grid classes
        markdown
            p use block grid classes to have the grid view
            small note: the example bellow uses `grid-lg-2 grid-md-2 grid-sm-2 grid-xs-1` classes
        .source_example
            .container
                | !{pb.render('cover-image' , 'recent-issues.json', 'pericles', {"shared": {"model": {"config": {"wrapper": "true", "className": ["grid-lg-2 grid-md-2 grid-sm-2 grid-xs-1"]}}}})}


        h3 Most recent
        markdown
            p used `cover-image--parentInfo` class in the example bellow
        .source_example
            .container
                | !{pb.render('cover-image' , 'most-recent.json', 'pericles', {"shared": {"model": {"config": {"wrapper": "true", "className": ["grid-lg-2 grid-md-2 grid-sm-2 grid-xs-1 cover-image--parentInfo"]}}}})}


        h3 New example
        .source_example
            .container
                | !{pb.render('cover-image' , 'new.json', 'pericles')}


        h3 Slider of cover images
        markdown
            p use `slider` as action to display the cover images in slide effect
            small note: we have two designs for the slider cover images
                ul
                    li use `slider-covers` as a wrapper class to display arrows
                    li use `slider-covers--light` as a wrapper class to hide the arrows

        h3 Slider of cover images
        .source_example
            .container
                | !{pb.render('cover-image' , 'slider-tab.json', 'pericles', {"shared": {"model": {"config": {"wrapper": "true", "className": ["slider-covers"]}}}})}

        h3 Slider of cover images - light
        .source_example
            .container
                | !{pb.render('cover-image' , 'slider-tab-light.json', 'pericles', {"shared": {"model": {"config": {"wrapper": "true", "className": ["slider-covers--light"]}}}})}

        h3 test case
        .source_example
            .container
                .col-md-8
                    | !{pb.render('cover-image' , 'slider-tab.json', 'pericles', {"shared": {"model": {"config": {"wrapper": "true", "className": ["slider-covers"]}}}})}
                .col-md-4
                    | !{pb.render('cover-image' , 'slider-tab-light.json', 'pericles', {"shared": {"model": {"config": {"wrapper": "true", "className": ["slider-covers--light"]}}}})}
